  ('f7e9aa43-417e-5e9e-9a61-a0edaf4c5e65', 'Despite the infiltrate on the film she remained asymptomatic.', 'Despite the film change she still had having no symptoms despite disease or carriage.', '尽管片子上有浸润，她仍然无症状的。'),
