  ('e9d37374-4d49-53af-931c-9d14b09e1b27', 'The overnight note described the finding as subarachnoid.', 'The night note described the finding as beneath the arachnoid, as in subarachnoid space.', '夜间病程把该发现写成蛛网膜下的。'),
