  ('53b4c2ef-c952-5565-906d-b397964eb9c8', 'Despite fluids, airborne droplets continued into the second hospital day.', 'infection spread by respiratory droplets in the air was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，飞沫传播仍持续到住院第二天。'),
