  ('d684b50a-7ea3-53d7-9e9e-bd8f14326493', 'The epiglottis covers the larynx during swallowing.', 'This structure covers the larynx during swallowing.', '该会厌在体内承担这一功能。'),
  ('220fc233-7db3-547d-8b4c-0db64f0bfe9a', 'The scan showed hold-up in the cystic duct.', 'Imaging showed material stalling in this passage (duct joining the gallbladder to the bile duct).', '扫描显示胆囊管有滞留。'),
  ('af75ca92-6718-5c08-858d-7a562d0722ca', 'The operation stayed clear of the nasal cavity whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (air space inside the nose) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开鼻腔。'),
  ('8038ad78-df7a-5a9c-9ef2-fa5bef44e03a', 'The common bile duct carries bile into the duodenum.', 'This structure carries bile into the duodenum.', '该胆总管在体内承担这一功能。'),
  ('f887a275-61d8-53dc-bd01-1dce3620bd6b', 'In the gut wall, peristalsis moved contents onward between meals.', 'Wave-like squeezing in the bowel pushed contents along between meals.', '肠壁的蠕动在餐间把内容物向前推进。'),
  ('7bdd4bc4-5dbc-5191-98d1-ae27c9cee63b', 'After the insult, detoxification occurred in the affected tissue.', 'After the insult this process (process of making a harmful substance less toxic) took place in the tissue.', '损伤之后，受累组织发生了解毒。'),
  ('e29bdd7e-067c-5938-a6ed-ca366e6673b6', 'The exam localized the injury to the fundus.', 'The exam found the injury at this structure (part of a hollow organ farthest from its opening).', '查体把损伤定位在底；底部。'),
  ('24fa9108-3014-56af-9f59-28aa34bbf2e7', 'After the insult, emulsification occurred in the affected tissue.', 'After the insult this process (breaking fat into tiny droplets so enzymes can act) took place in the tissue.', '损伤之后，受累组织发生了乳化。'),
  ('8bce982e-f1a2-5753-9c9f-341c7d424085', 'The operation stayed clear of the antrum whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (cavity, such as the gastric antrum) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开窦；腔。'),
  ('0f842892-9666-57f7-9761-6748629ee576', 'Fat droplets persisted in stool when bile acid delivery into the duodenum failed.', 'Fat stayed in the stool when liver-made acids did not reach the bowel.', '胆汁酸无法进入十二指肠时，大便中持续出现脂肪滴。'),
  ('29228e77-661a-5a02-9e1f-a808269d6f5c', 'The flare of gingivitis brought pain and a rising CRP.', 'When inflammation of the gums worsened, pain and CRP rose together.', '牙龈炎加重时出现疼痛和 CRP 升高。'),
  ('76c928ff-7642-5e2e-aeac-19e39a1f1a47', 'The laparoscope was performed after consent and a review of the anatomy.', 'This procedure (instrument for looking into the peritoneal cavity) was done after consent and an anatomy review.', '在知情同意并复习局部解剖后，实施了腹腔镜。'),
  ('755ab307-f1ab-5333-ba6f-259bb8547af3', 'Despite fluids, peptic ulcer continued into the second hospital day.', 'ulcer of stomach or duodenum from acid injury was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，消化性溃疡仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('bddb210c-a360-5b8a-b777-e91b5400d3a6', 'The flare of pancreatitis brought pain and a rising CRP.', 'When inflammation of the pancreas worsened, pain and CRP rose together.', '胰腺炎加重时出现疼痛和 CRP 升高。'),
  ('0f5bf9bd-40bf-54d7-88f7-fc7d89d64437', 'Overnight vomiting worsened and directed the next exam.', 'Overnight forceful expulsion of gastric contents through the mouth got worse and directed the next exam.', '夜间呕吐加重，并指导下一步检查。'),
  ('410669cc-c023-5f1f-9dff-a2004ada0a7e', 'Bowel sounds were absent, fitting paralytic ileus rather than a mechanical block.', 'No bowel sounds fitted obstruction from lost peristalsis.', '肠鸣音消失，符合麻痹性肠梗阻而非机械性梗阻。'),
  ('8e2d838f-1416-5c75-9c07-5d77caec0abb', 'Despite fluids, perforation continued into the second hospital day.', 'hole through the wall of a hollow organ was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，穿孔仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('83336632-6e8f-5810-bb1d-96bbab704b42', 'The barium showed the collection before drainage.', 'This study (radiopaque contrast used in GI imaging) showed the collection before drainage.', '引流前，钡显示了那处积液。'),
  ('e45b8182-cb14-5d1f-babc-d9b6b8cc7d21', 'Overnight physiology still depended on autodigestion remaining intact.', 'Overnight physiology still needed this process (tissue digested by its own enzymes, as in pancreatitis) to keep working.', '夜间生理仍取决于自身消化保持完整。'),
  ('0f4137f1-3df5-5334-8d29-6ce0d7120a46', 'The hiatal examination focused on a hiatus, especially the diaphragmatic hiatus.', 'The exam looked at a hiatus, especially the diaphragmatic hiatus.', '裂孔的检查聚焦在相关结构上。'),
  ('96101132-cb0f-58fa-a511-a0999c1ea36a', 'The infarct showed necrosis of myocytes that had lost nuclei and staining.', 'Dead heart-muscle cells in the infarct no longer took up stain.', '梗死区心肌细胞坏死，核与染色均消失。'),
  ('b5133be2-4502-57e4-8869-5317708e6483', 'The history, exam, and labs established hernia as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made protrusion of a viscus through a weak wall the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把疝定为工作诊断。'),
  ('2b900750-6bac-55c7-87b3-7be11d39c34b', 'The overnight note described the finding as epigastric.', 'The night note described the finding as in the upper central abdomen over the stomach.', '夜间病程把该发现写成上腹部的。'),
  ('50de46a6-9d94-5d13-8316-bf4c3963aaee', 'The endoscopy was performed after consent and a review of the anatomy.', 'This procedure (inspection of a hollow organ with a lighted tube) was done after consent and an anatomy review.', '在知情同意并复习局部解剖后，实施了内镜检查。'),
  ('fb89c984-2474-5be6-b26a-e0dfb9b20a02', 'Fever and local pain over the appendix fitted appendicitis.', 'Heat and pain there fitted inflammation of the appendix.', '局部发热和疼痛符合阑尾炎。'),
  ('1b440205-58ca-59d2-81c8-916479f599f9', 'The history, exam, and labs established hemorrhage as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made escape of blood from vessels the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把出血定为工作诊断。'),
  ('d5f2e043-537d-5a28-a777-91a949e63dbe', 'The operation stayed clear of the navel whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (umbilicus) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开脐。'),
  ('bf9d2f89-4cec-5b65-a913-a69ad4d60566', 'The histamine disturbance moved the blood pH away from normal.', 'This acid-base actor (mediator of acid secretion and allergic inflammation) moved blood pH away from normal.', '组胺的紊乱使血 pH 偏离正常。'),
  ('cc4506bd-879b-54ac-8080-5733b0ddd82f', 'The flare of peritonitis brought pain and a rising CRP.', 'When inflammation of the peritoneum worsened, pain and CRP rose together.', '腹膜炎加重时出现疼痛和 CRP 升高。'),
  ('7f0c67b2-5012-5952-9ac1-c70e2236a31f', 'The operation stayed clear of the chest cavity whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (thoracic cavity containing lungs and heart) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开胸腔。'),
  ('8172cbe3-a32a-51ba-8146-d4f1ee00b87d', 'Fever and local pain over chronic colonic mucosal inflammation with ulcers fitted ulcerative colitis.', 'Heat and pain there fitted chronic colonic mucosal inflammation with ulcers.', '局部发热和疼痛符合溃疡性结肠炎。'),
  ('0b892f69-8521-54e5-98e7-36c32797387a', 'The scan showed swelling around the diaphragm.', 'Imaging showed swelling around this structure (main muscle of inspiration).', '扫描显示膈周围肿胀。'),
  ('4cf9af8c-206d-50d9-8af5-83e192b214a0', 'The overnight order stopped antibiotic after the new rash appeared.', 'The night order stopped this medicine (drug used to treat bacterial infection) when the rash appeared.', '新皮疹出现后，夜间医嘱停用了抗生素。'),
  ('40671da1-ac7c-5116-a871-a5490951e8d6', 'Fever and local pain over the stomach lining fitted gastritis.', 'Heat and pain there fitted inflammation of the stomach lining.', '局部发热和疼痛符合胃炎。'),
  ('77725943-1e4c-5c13-a94b-c44dffdd6017', 'The overnight chart recorded fistula among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded abnormal tract between two epithelia or to the skin among the active findings.', '夜间病程把瘘记入当前发现。'),
  ('bd096a46-038c-5219-9ba4-6103b4dc4992', 'The operation stayed clear of the diverticulum whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (pouch bulging from a hollow organ wall) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开憩室。'),
  ('79dd8405-aed6-517e-a174-a676c3f88215', 'Despite fluids, cirrhosis continued into the second hospital day.', 'end-stage fibrosis and nodularity of the liver was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，肝硬化仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('8aecbf4f-db2e-5511-a5fd-778bcbbdb048', 'The flare of diverticulitis brought pain and a rising CRP.', 'When inflammation of a colonic diverticulum worsened, pain and CRP rose together.', '憩室炎加重时出现疼痛和 CRP 升高。'),
  ('36b04fee-4c33-58fb-a00a-2410c4f9d85d', 'Despite fluids, hepatomegaly continued into the second hospital day.', 'enlargement of the liver was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，肝肿大仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('10f99131-0544-5882-9403-b27aba9ac523', 'The history, exam, and labs established diverticulosis as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made presence of diverticula, usually in the colon the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把憩室病定为工作诊断。'),
  ('06d76ca6-7981-5701-8cc0-97d331f498b1', 'Despite fluids, edema continued into the second hospital day.', 'excess interstitial fluid in tissues was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，水肿仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('f55eab32-0d16-5d1a-8b2b-43b14f678444', 'The history, exam, and labs established polyps as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made abnormal mucosal growths, often in the bowel the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把息肉定为工作诊断。'),
  ('9cafb3ca-493d-58ef-8c56-8c48424c9200', 'Overnight jaundice worsened and directed the next exam.', 'Overnight yellowing of skin or sclera from high bilirubin got worse and directed the next exam.', '夜间黄疸加重，并指导下一步检查。'),
  ('f6134232-b63b-5e0c-8125-e311d87435e7', 'She reported diarrhea as the complaint that brought her in.', 'She came in because of frequent passage of loose or watery stool.', '她把腹泻说成促使就诊的主诉。'),
  ('feebbebe-0fcc-5ec4-8534-ec19798ffb4f', 'The biopsy kept normal lobular architecture despite mild inflammation.', 'Tissue layout of the lobules was still intact.', '活检显示小叶结构仍在，仅有轻度炎症。'),
  ('5bf1d9e0-d8ce-5009-ae74-83eee05eac18', 'The stool test detected occult blood that the eye could not see.', 'The stool test found blood not visible to the eye.', '大便检查检出肉眼看不见的隐血。'),
  ('82c6617f-e254-551a-accc-3b96ca0ba789', 'The overnight chart recorded nodule among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded small firm lump in tissue among the active findings.', '夜间病程把结节记入当前发现。'),
  ('0e77e0c8-13b4-5776-ae98-da5956882376', 'The proctoscope was performed after consent and a review of the anatomy.', 'This procedure (instrument for inspecting the rectum) was done after consent and an anatomy review.', '在知情同意并复习局部解剖后，实施了直肠镜。'),
  ('9df25e21-8df5-5eb0-a6f2-7f9a27ac8fc5', 'The overnight note described the finding as micronodular.', 'The night note described the finding as made of very small nodules, as in some cirrhosis.', '夜间病程把该发现写成小结节性的。'),
  ('8ca58d58-2699-576b-a1d9-aae9179223e1', 'The sigmoidoscope was performed after consent and a review of the anatomy.', 'This procedure (instrument for inspecting the sigmoid colon) was done after consent and an anatomy review.', '在知情同意并复习局部解剖后，实施了乙状结肠镜。'),
  ('17a41053-dbdb-5da8-bdf1-7467d2b644ed', 'The overnight note described the finding as macronodular.', 'The night note described the finding as made of large nodules.', '夜间病程把该发现写成大结节性的。'),
  ('b8f4ce83-7238-554d-a97e-9ec84f502388', 'The colonoscope was performed after consent and a review of the anatomy.', 'This procedure (instrument for inspecting the whole colon) was done after consent and an anatomy review.', '在知情同意并复习局部解剖后，实施了结肠镜。'),
  ('98fb5c01-3ff9-566a-b9c7-2d3dcd11740f', 'The overnight note described the finding as lobular.', 'The night note described the finding as arranged in or relating to lobules.', '夜间病程把该发现写成小叶的。'),
  ('7fbdaf3f-0a5d-5ffa-99c5-e9a0380eb741', 'The ileostomy was performed after consent and a review of the anatomy.', 'This procedure (surgical opening of ileum onto the abdominal wall) was done after consent and an anatomy review.', '在知情同意并复习局部解剖后，实施了回肠造口术。'),
  ('5f261d64-d7e8-5e02-8aa7-f0b39522d477', 'Despite fluids, cholelithiasis continued into the second hospital day.', 'gallstones in the gallbladder or bile ducts was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，胆石症仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('6975b1cd-7662-53b0-ba67-67faa1605ebe', 'The colostomy was performed after consent and a review of the anatomy.', 'This procedure (surgical opening of colon onto the abdominal wall) was done after consent and an anatomy review.', '在知情同意并复习局部解剖后，实施了结肠造口术。'),
  ('cfbc2383-f9fe-5fd3-aaea-c838b8b9b4d7', 'The biopsy confirmed cholecystitis and excluded a competing infection.', 'Tissue exam confirmed inflammation of the gallbladder and ruled out another infection.', '活检证实了胆囊炎，并排除了另一种感染。'),
  ('7c900f71-537e-5c66-8b37-248aa66a6267', 'The gastroduodenostomy was performed after consent and a review of the anatomy.', 'This procedure (surgical join between stomach and duodenum) was done after consent and an anatomy review.', '在知情同意并复习局部解剖后，实施了胃十二指肠吻合术。'),
  ('efcf44f0-7a25-5d8c-9802-2a8da5bb415e', 'The overnight chart recorded biliary colic among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded wave-like pain from a stone obstructing a bile duct among the active findings.', '夜间病程把胆绞痛记入当前发现。'),
  ('94f28abe-475c-5775-a6db-dcb7fa3969af', 'She reported nausea as the complaint that brought her in.', 'She came in because of unpleasant urge to vomit.', '她把恶心说成促使就诊的主诉。'),
  ('17abf31f-02f8-55d6-8b49-285bcf5c5714', 'After the coloproctostomy, pain scores fell and diet was restarted.', 'After this procedure (surgical join between colon and rectum), pain fell and diet restarted.', '结肠直肠吻合术之后，疼痛评分下降并重新开始进食。'),
  ('a70bda5b-50bd-52ac-87d4-880fab4553b2', 'The cholecystectomy was performed after consent and a review of the anatomy.', 'This procedure (surgical removal of the gallbladder) was done after consent and an anatomy review.', '在知情同意并复习局部解剖后，实施了胆囊切除术。'),
  ('53756993-5dde-5d38-8f27-554a2d1a80a3', 'Despite nearby swelling the pulmonary veins still return oxygenated blood from lungs to the left atrium.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still return oxygenated blood from lungs to the left atrium.', '尽管附近肿胀，肺静脉仍在工作。'),
  ('f88b5766-a794-59db-a092-611a189ab66b', 'The exam localized the injury to the maxillary sinus.', 'The exam found the injury at this structure (paranasal sinus in the maxilla).', '查体把损伤定位在上颌窦。'),
  ('4ad0561b-9dd5-59d1-be5a-802332ed3410', 'After injury the irritant no longer inflames or provokes a tissue.', 'After injury this structure no longer inflames or provokes a tissue.', '损伤之后，刺激物不再能完成应有的工作。'),
  ('d753d947-6f00-5c73-b949-8f947093acb2', 'The operation stayed clear of the paranasal sinus whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (air sinus around the nasal cavity) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开鼻旁窦。'),
  ('72f68459-9d4e-5e35-850f-a5a62c14cdad', 'The exam found tenderness over the frontal sinus after the fall.', 'Pressing this structure (paranasal sinus in the frontal bone) hurt after the fall.', '跌倒后，查体发现额窦压痛。'),
  ('acc859b9-4bc6-51a1-bf77-be1ca5a9d92a', 'The overnight chart recorded ethmoidal sinus among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded paranasal sinuses in the ethmoid among the active findings.', '夜间病程把筛窦记入当前发现。'),
  ('b057d209-440d-5f70-8831-8562cbae41a6', 'The operation stayed clear of the nostril whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (external opening of the nose) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开鼻孔。'),
  ('7f1ae458-06e9-5ba2-ba3b-f06f097d7dbe', 'The fall produced a fracture involving the sphenoid sinus.', 'The fall broke this structure (paranasal sinus in the sphenoid bone).', '跌倒造成蝶窦骨折。'),
  ('72e598d3-053a-51e5-81db-a73bb26d2383', 'The scan showed swelling around the nasopharynx.', 'Imaging showed swelling around this structure (pharynx behind the nasal cavity).', '扫描显示鼻咽周围肿胀。'),
  ('80a11f2f-5c70-505f-a42e-6162f2cf38b2', 'The operation stayed clear of the oropharynx whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (pharynx behind the oral cavity) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开口咽。'),
  ('0bad0dbe-2b7a-54b4-9223-8236c013e621', 'The exam localized the injury to the apex.', 'The exam found the injury at this structure (pointed end of an organ, such as the lung apex).', '查体把损伤定位在尖；顶端。'),
  ('cd9ee2e2-e1e5-51f8-88b0-81268517263f', 'The scan showed swelling around the hypopharynx.', 'Imaging showed swelling around this structure (lowest part of the pharynx; laryngopharynx).', '扫描显示下咽周围肿胀。'),
  ('a65c3fcc-e46d-5bdb-8342-cc27111f1312', 'Endoscopy reached the injured lining of the hilum.', 'The scope reached the injured lining of this passage (site where vessels and bronchi enter an organ).', '内镜到达了门的损伤黏膜。'),
  ('3dfaab4d-e66d-593d-b324-a3670a151b99', 'The exam localized the injury to the laryngopharynx.', 'The exam found the injury at this structure (pharynx beside the larynx).', '查体把损伤定位在喉咽。'),
  ('2dff758d-eb6d-5d92-9ba2-e2a6c6f2c1fd', 'The fall produced a fracture of the collarbone, and the shoulder sagged.', 'The fall broke the clavicle, and the shoulder dropped.', '跌倒造成锁骨骨折，肩部随之塌下。'),
  ('6b4a3bb7-dc79-5f2d-8b62-6c56c3c0e895', 'The operation stayed clear of the adenoids whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (pharyngeal tonsil tissue in the nasopharynx) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开腺样体。'),
  ('4c3fcdec-3f12-534a-bdd6-5b54c524898c', 'The hypopharyngeal findings involved the hypopharynx rather than a distant system.', 'The findings about the hypopharynx explained the main complaint.', '这些下咽的发现涉及相关结构，而不是远处系统。'),
  ('58b2bd4f-805a-51cd-994b-a47beda81857', 'The overnight chart recorded mediastinum among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded central chest compartment between the lungs among the active findings.', '夜间病程把纵隔记入当前发现。'),
  ('f0918099-a3ae-5c93-9408-724e2c60005d', 'The operation stayed clear of the pharyngeal tonsils whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (lymphoid tissue in the nasopharynx; adenoids) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开咽扁桃体。'),
  ('519da02a-ba3e-55ea-84f2-22fe9f8db0a3', 'The fall produced a fracture involving the thoracic cavity.', 'The fall broke this structure (chest cavity enclosed by ribs and diaphragm).', '跌倒造成胸腔骨折。'),
  ('ba686ee2-011b-5ed7-b80a-391c959b56b0', 'The scan showed swelling around the abdominal cavity.', 'Imaging showed swelling around this structure (peritoneal cavity of the abdomen).', '扫描显示腹腔周围肿胀。'),
  ('b9f11f45-fe65-595d-89c4-c66faa321c31', 'The operation stayed clear of the palatine tonsils whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (tonsils in the oropharynx) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开腭扁桃体。'),
  ('59cc42ab-70d4-5d53-aa3c-08b4c9a3c0b2', 'Peak drug levels arrived faster after inhalation than after oral dosing.', 'Breathing the medicine in raised blood levels sooner than swallowing it.', '吸入给药比口服更快达到峰浓度。'),
  ('38dea84b-c519-5b49-a03d-bdf2ff661db7', 'The scan showed swelling around the tongue tonsil.', 'Imaging showed swelling around this structure (lymphoid tissue at the tongue base; lingual tonsil).', '扫描显示舌扁桃体周围肿胀。'),
  ('4a7375cd-a3ee-5176-a3bf-88d6c0ebb5b2', 'Despite nearby swelling the vocal cords still produce voice.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still produce voice.', '尽管附近肿胀，声带仍在工作。'),
  ('358cc8ee-4bb1-5e73-a727-6711130f2cdc', 'Slow exhalation through pursed lips helped dump carbon dioxide.', 'Breathing out slowly through pursed lips cleared more carbon dioxide.', '缩唇缓慢呼气有助于排出二氧化碳。'),
  ('212bdf3d-c696-5bed-bd73-08d9047c0118', 'After injury the mucous membrane no longer secretes mucus.', 'After injury this structure no longer secretes mucus.', '损伤之后，黏膜不再能完成应有的工作。'),
  ('d0d8e833-b105-553e-bc46-b579006d02be', 'The operation stayed clear of the brainstem whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (midbrain, pons, and medulla connecting brain to cord) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开脑干。'),
  ('4b95d2bd-97a2-56d1-897c-b17976dc2926', 'The scar was dense fibrous connective tissue rather than normal dermis.', 'The scar was collagen-rich supporting tissue, not normal skin.', '瘢痕是致密纤维结缔组织，而不是正常真皮。'),
  ('b552d0a6-a5e6-5625-ad74-a7087cee5249', 'After injury the phrenic nerve no longer drives the diaphragm.', 'After injury this structure no longer drives the diaphragm.', '损伤之后，膈神经不再能完成应有的工作。'),
  ('2faee99d-e182-502a-8044-536ec531d07c', 'Despite nearby swelling the acid still lowers pH.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still lowers pH.', '尽管附近肿胀，酸仍在工作。'),
  ('b69a74d7-3095-5d06-8e84-4219ce9a2d74', 'The scan showed hold-up in the bronchi.', 'Imaging showed material stalling in this passage (two main airway branches from the trachea).', '扫描显示支气管有滞留。'),
  ('5665add3-7291-5bf4-8077-1794dc38104f', 'Gastric acidity rose after the meal and then fell with antacid.', 'Stomach pH dropped with food and recovered after the buffer.', '餐后胃酸度升高，抗酸药后又下降。'),
  ('c75f43ff-031a-5190-8d2f-29fc3aed224e', 'The scan showed hold-up in the bronchiole.', 'Imaging showed material stalling in this passage (small airway distal to the bronchi).', '扫描显示细支气管有滞留。'),
  ('6da3046f-5fe3-5f51-80b8-e8a65f7681b4', 'The acidosis lowers blood pH or bicarbonate.', 'This structure lowers blood pH or bicarbonate.', '该酸中毒在体内承担这一功能。'),
  ('f26eec7d-4b13-5cfd-9d40-f50f7e7d7af9', 'The alkalinity disturbance moved the blood pH away from normal.', 'This acid-base actor (how alkaline a fluid or tissue is) moved blood pH away from normal.', '碱度的紊乱使血 pH 偏离正常。'),
  ('9cf5c74c-0016-5afd-83cb-d9e0c1f9dd7e', 'The operation stayed clear of the alveoli whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (tiny air sacs where gas exchange occurs) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开肺泡。'),
  ('b5607f0d-d9b5-5d73-b17a-09b05b2acfb5', 'The alkali spill raised the pH and burned the esophageal mucosa.', 'The base spill made the fluid less acidic and burned the gullet lining.', '碱液溅入使 pH 升高，并灼伤食管黏膜。'),
  ('e9b01dd1-dbd9-598c-b54a-35c24fe04783', 'The overnight chart recorded epithelium among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded covering tissue of surfaces and glands among the active findings.', '夜间病程把上皮记入当前发现。'),
  ('58dbbb97-3af5-5ed0-9bbb-03e9d1bcce43', 'Despite nearby swelling the alkalosis still raises blood pH or bicarbonate.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still raises blood pH or bicarbonate.', '尽管附近肿胀，碱中毒仍在工作。'),
  ('a3302b73-f9df-59af-8f4b-73db5ffd8515', 'The exam localized the injury to the parietal pleura.', 'The exam found the injury at this structure (pleural layer lining the chest wall).', '查体把损伤定位在壁层胸膜。'),
  ('0a44a48b-7fed-54a1-9e5c-afc8014f52b7', 'After the insult, hyperventilation occurred in the affected tissue.', 'After the insult this process (breathing faster or deeper than metabolic need) took place in the tissue.', '损伤之后，受累组织发生了过度通气。'),
  ('8fcafd4f-d893-5374-b2ce-ba417c39d24f', 'The operation stayed clear of the visceral pleura whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (pleural layer covering the lung) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开脏层胸膜。'),
  ('76d360d1-4523-59a9-a0f5-045412774832', 'After the insult, hypoventilation occurred in the affected tissue.', 'After the insult this process (breathing too little for metabolic need) took place in the tissue.', '损伤之后，受累组织发生了通气不足。'),
