  ('554bd88d-a49d-5c9f-a42b-d5f50290430b', 'Overnight sampling of mucus changed the next decision.', 'Overnight sampling of sticky secretion of mucous glands changed the next decision.', '夜间对黏液的取样改变了下一步决定。'),
  ('9bde0500-f16d-58a0-847a-e586684d6e89', 'The exam localized the injury to the oblique fissure.', 'The exam found the injury at this structure (fissure separating upper and lower lung lobes).', '查体把损伤定位在斜裂。'),
  ('2985b86e-51c0-50bb-b190-309f66158671', 'The history, exam, and labs established pneumonia as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made infection of the lung parenchyma the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把肺炎定为工作诊断。'),
  ('357d322b-d6c6-5e50-b4c4-0955e8562c4c', 'The pleural fluid was rich in protein, so the lab called it exudates.', 'The chest fluid had enough protein to count as inflammatory leak.', '胸水蛋白较高，化验将其称为渗出液。'),
  ('cfec0bab-2d96-5e58-be8c-826410840693', 'The history, exam, and labs established tuberculosis as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made infection with Mycobacterium tuberculosis the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把结核病定为工作诊断。'),
  ('e786feb0-573d-5252-aea8-b2250e5f5679', 'Overnight physiology still depended on solidification remaining intact.', 'Overnight physiology still needed this process (lung tissue becoming firm, as in consolidation) to keep working.', '夜间生理仍取决于实变保持完整。'),
  ('ff2a2715-f46a-5743-89c2-6fafb27eefdb', 'The history, exam, and labs established asthma as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made reversible airway obstruction with inflammation and spasm the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把哮喘定为工作诊断。'),
  ('773150ad-2317-542d-8d08-5e3d8033779d', 'Despite fluids, consolidation continued into the second hospital day.', 'airless lung filled with exudate, as in pneumonia was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，实变仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('3a9942f3-5a64-56bd-b58f-5d83ff7574ab', 'The finding was allergic on examination.', 'On exam the finding was caused by or relating to allergy.', '查体时该发现是过敏的的。'),
  ('285d6a82-bd53-5824-8f64-f20e6bdd766d', 'Overnight dyspnea worsened and directed the next exam.', 'Overnight sensation of difficult or labored breathing got worse and directed the next exam.', '夜间呼吸困难加重，并指导下一步检查。'),
  ('507ab76e-5159-5e4f-9332-c2a0e297bd0b', 'The history, exam, and labs established emphysema as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made destruction of alveolar walls with air trapping the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把肺气肿定为工作诊断。'),
  ('82bb5ccb-2431-506d-a213-b1a9611036e1', 'Overnight cyanosis worsened and directed the next exam.', 'Overnight bluish skin or mucosa from low oxygenated hemoglobin got worse and directed the next exam.', '夜间发绀加重，并指导下一步检查。'),
  ('163e3c58-0f86-55a3-ad12-c10916add2e9', 'The history, exam, and labs established influenza as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made acute viral respiratory infection the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把流行性感冒定为工作诊断。'),
  ('d410e888-d482-5851-a4a2-afdf550b3b43', 'Overnight wheeze worsened and directed the next exam.', 'Overnight high-pitched whistling sound from narrowed airways got worse and directed the next exam.', '夜间哮鸣加重，并指导下一步检查。'),
