  ('9dca5d3f-0040-5550-baae-fc07d55ee50b', 'Despite nearby swelling the steroids still suppress inflammation.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still suppress inflammation.', '尽管附近肿胀，甾体；糖皮质激素仍在工作。'),
  ('0280771f-706f-536c-93bf-e18818636e1c', 'The history, exam, and labs established lobar pneumonia as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made pneumonia involving a whole lobe the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把大叶性肺炎定为工作诊断。'),
  ('209c9ad2-f435-5e19-96c7-9cb30c9586f6', 'After injury the allergen no longer triggers allergy.', 'After injury this structure no longer triggers allergy.', '损伤之后，变应原不再能完成应有的工作。'),
  ('c8b10455-ab04-5f70-a918-2bdd241d5a20', 'Despite nearby swelling the polio still can paralyze.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still can paralyze.', '尽管附近肿胀，脊髓灰质炎仍在工作。'),
  ('41b3aab7-1fa0-508e-ba5f-08ac8e1d70e1', 'Despite fluids, bronchopneumonia continued into the second hospital day.', 'patchy pneumonia centered on bronchioles was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，支气管肺炎仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('681256b8-ff52-527e-82a8-f9f6dcefb4be', 'The stroke can paralyze the right arm and face.', 'The stroke can take away movement in the right arm and face.', '这次卒中可以使右侧上肢和面部瘫痪。'),
  ('1af4e318-8985-5d15-82e9-c461fa28b6f8', 'The biopsy confirmed pleurisy and excluded a competing infection.', 'Tissue exam confirmed inflammation of the pleura, often painful and ruled out another infection.', '活检证实了胸膜炎，并排除了另一种感染。'),
  ('fe4fe13c-ee4e-591e-bb0e-24b14adec6d0', 'The finding was mature on examination.', 'On exam the finding was fully developed.', '查体时该发现是成熟的的。'),
  ('bac3f4c6-150e-559f-81d3-d70630d03d32', 'The overnight chart recorded tubercle among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded small rounded nodule, classically in tuberculosis among the active findings.', '夜间病程把结节；结核结节记入当前发现。'),
  ('98fc47bb-c7d1-516c-836c-fe0b17bf9725', 'The infant was born prematurely at 32 weeks.', 'The baby arrived earlier than the expected time, at 32 weeks.', '婴儿在 32 周就提前出生了。'),
  ('85707daf-d35e-5fd8-bd0f-34f8ad550777', 'Overnight hemoptysis worsened and directed the next exam.', 'Overnight coughing up blood from the lower airway got worse and directed the next exam.', '夜间咯血加重，并指导下一步检查。'),
