  ('0d481607-939a-5ada-b668-3188aba96305', 'Despite fluids, phlegm continued into the second hospital day.', 'thick mucus from the airways was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，痰仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('8bc8de95-f1dd-5b87-9c92-73eafc77506d', 'After injury the diuretics no longer increase urine output.', 'After injury this structure no longer increase urine output.', '损伤之后，利尿剂不再能完成应有的工作。'),
  ('f375a170-552b-5033-9190-c26c5a1332fb', 'The scan showed swelling around the atrium.', 'Imaging showed swelling around this structure (upper receiving chamber of the heart).', '扫描显示心房周围肿胀。'),
  ('493cceff-41b4-5e2d-9cf7-9c62e1bf3dfd', 'The history, exam, and labs established bronchospasm as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made sudden narrowing of bronchi by smooth-muscle contraction the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把支气管痉挛定为工作诊断。'),
  ('50b2c540-c09e-5c37-ab1c-dbdb29693967', 'Despite fluids, hypercapnia continued into the second hospital day.', 'excess carbon dioxide in the blood was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，高碳酸血症仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('23b5415d-3686-5ddc-8dca-adbad78d56b7', 'The flare of simple chronic bronchitis brought pain and a rising CRP.', 'When chronic bronchitis with cough and sputum but little obstruction worsened, pain and CRP rose together.', '单纯慢性支气管炎加重时出现疼痛和 CRP 升高。'),
  ('51ed92cf-e457-5c3c-9b20-f35d945d1bb2', 'Despite fluids, pneumothorax continued into the second hospital day.', 'air in the pleural space collapsing the lung was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，气胸仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('0d02c005-453b-5fed-9113-fb356a64051a', 'The history, exam, and labs established pneumoconiosis as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made lung disease from inhaled mineral dust the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把尘肺定为工作诊断。'),
  ('ecd707b3-c6bc-5c10-a241-97d919575a71', 'The flare of chronic obstructive bronchitis brought pain and a rising CRP.', 'When chronic bronchitis with airflow obstruction worsened, pain and CRP rose together.', '慢性阻塞性支气管炎加重时出现疼痛和 CRP 升高。'),
  ('f332d63a-da1a-54eb-889e-cff341e98bf7', 'The history, exam, and labs established silicosis as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made pneumoconiosis from silica dust the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把矽肺定为工作诊断。'),
  ('0e66c165-9b85-5f21-87fb-d84da6eb02a1', 'Despite fluids, anthracosilicosis continued into the second hospital day.', 'pneumoconiosis from coal and silica dust was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，煤矽肺仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('bee5c646-fe6d-5045-994b-8a7a03c33eed', 'The flare of asthmatic bronchitis brought pain and a rising CRP.', 'When bronchitis with a wheezing, reversible component worsened, pain and CRP rose together.', '哮喘性支气管炎加重时出现疼痛和 CRP 升高。'),
  ('3ea6e960-091d-56d2-a721-9f65a55e7ddf', 'The biopsy confirmed bronchitis and excluded a competing infection.', 'Tissue exam confirmed inflammation of the bronchi and ruled out another infection.', '活检证实了支气管炎，并排除了另一种感染。'),
  ('25b1228a-c3d1-5ed7-b892-0a242d77d8d5', 'The finding was noxious on examination.', 'On exam the finding was harmful to tissue or health.', '查体时该发现是有害的的。'),
  ('05ef2ce7-3e32-5221-987a-c80433d929b7', 'Despite fluids, bronchiectasis continued into the second hospital day.', 'permanent abnormal widening of bronchi was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，支气管扩张仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('8adeb74a-3d63-5232-ba9b-eb8b9f9af28f', 'Despite nearby swelling the atherosclerosis still narrows arteries.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still narrows arteries.', '尽管附近肿胀，动脉粥样硬化仍在工作。'),
  ('08d913bd-ff68-568d-b8cc-377d042c43d2', 'The systolic pressure stayed above 180 mmHg on repeated cuff readings.', 'The arterial pressure during contraction stayed above 180.', '反复袖带测量，收缩压持续高于 180 mmHg。'),
  ('13fcbfd8-2d85-5ec1-8840-b6cd1824e451', 'The overnight chart recorded diastolic pressure among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded arterial pressure during ventricular relaxation among the active findings.', '夜间病程把舒张压记入当前发现。'),
  ('190c163e-1d9e-51ba-a53f-9cecc2b93050', 'The operation stayed clear of the lumen whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (inner open space of a tubular organ) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开管腔。'),
  ('f4db3cb4-8e7c-5f1f-8af4-a5a91aa9f74d', 'The history, exam, and labs established congestive heart failure as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made heart failure with fluid backup in lungs or body the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把充血性心力衰竭定为工作诊断。'),
  ('389f3f8f-93b4-5c3a-949c-7e43ccdbe784', 'Despite fluids, ischemia continued into the second hospital day.', 'insufficient blood flow to a tissue was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，缺血仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('6b3c4179-0ca1-54c3-9046-2226edc15146', 'The history, exam, and labs established coronary heart disease as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made atherosclerotic disease of the coronary arteries the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把冠心病定为工作诊断。'),
  ('733034a9-7cca-54ae-8054-1abb1bcdb17e', 'Echo showed a vegetation on the mitral valve after the new fever.', 'Echo showed a clot-like mass on the valve after the new fever.', '新发热后，超声心动图显示二尖瓣上有赘生物。'),
  ('c03dacf8-cc07-5998-9984-26aafedd8f44', 'She reported angina pectoris as the complaint that brought her in.', 'She came in because of chest pain from myocardial ischemia.', '她把心绞痛说成促使就诊的主诉。'),
  ('2c8c556b-681e-5458-833a-4725b42d3ae5', 'Despite fluids, essential hypertension continued into the second hospital day.', 'high blood pressure without an identified secondary cause was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，原发性高血压仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('cae70a3f-1e92-5126-a218-360d105aeb1a', 'A clot in the femoral vein explained the swollen, painful calf.', 'A mass of coagulated blood in the thigh vein explained the swollen calf.', '股静脉内血凝块解释了小腿肿胀疼痛。'),
  ('6c83e093-5cfa-528a-be11-549f63118fad', 'Despite fluids, thrombosis continued into the second hospital day.', 'formation of a clot inside a vessel was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，血栓形成仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('05fdff18-1a32-5908-91a5-8fd43e86dabb', 'The history, exam, and labs established secondary hypertension as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made high blood pressure caused by another disease the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把继发性高血压定为工作诊断。'),
  ('f29e5812-643a-590e-8bd0-3c858106b81e', 'A clot in the thrombus explained the cold, pulseless limb.', 'A clot in this vessel (clot formed in situ inside a vessel or heart) explained the cold, pulseless limb.', '血栓内的血栓解释了肢体发冷、无脉。'),
  ('c8e730b6-4779-5f11-b902-4aa732251bf9', 'The overnight chart recorded myocardial infarction among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded death of heart muscle from blocked coronary flow among the active findings.', '夜间病程把心肌梗死记入当前发现。'),
  ('c5a07047-969a-5f3a-a0a2-d4d77b0b5c1f', 'The biopsy confirmed endocarditis and excluded a competing infection.', 'Tissue exam confirmed inflammation of the inner lining of the heart and ruled out another infection.', '活检证实了心内膜炎，并排除了另一种感染。'),
  ('006b75de-2301-525a-a1ef-b8dc1d43d2b1', 'Overnight sampling of pericardial tamponade changed the next decision.', 'Overnight sampling of compression of the heart by fluid in the pericardium changed the next decision.', '夜间对心包填塞的取样改变了下一步决定。'),
  ('cb08b78c-4216-5860-9c2d-c5cf551272a6', 'The overnight chart recorded arhythmia among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded irregular heartbeat (textbook spelling of arrhythmia) among the active findings.', '夜间病程把心律失常记入当前发现。'),
  ('8a91ca2d-f259-551b-bd8d-889ee726fb0b', 'The history, exam, and labs established fibrillation as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made rapid, uncoordinated muscle twitching, as in AF or VF the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把纤颤定为工作诊断。'),
  ('876f2a7e-ba5c-5481-88a6-92f6964930ca', 'Fever and local pain over the pericardium fitted pericarditis.', 'Heat and pain there fitted inflammation of the pericardium.', '局部发热和疼痛符合心包炎。'),
  ('bde84ae1-ebd9-504c-951d-bb76c9010b8a', 'The history, exam, and labs established embolism as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made blockage of a vessel by material carried in blood the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把栓塞定为工作诊断。'),
  ('4659d846-39ac-57d5-bf75-ab5df1f986ed', 'Despite fluids, shock continued into the second hospital day.', 'acute circulatory failure with inadequate tissue perfusion was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，休克仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('49e5c51d-143b-5ef5-bd56-b941070d8771', 'The embolus travels and lodges downstream.', 'This structure travels and lodges downstream.', '该栓子在体内承担这一功能。'),
  ('26582d53-0e0d-5c3a-bd15-fa49455b580a', 'Too little plasma overnight explained the new dryness and pain.', 'Too little of this fluid (liquid part of unclotted blood) explained the new dryness.', '血浆过少解释了新出现的干燥和疼痛。'),
  ('58858b9e-fb64-5364-97f1-1a6b8f36e87a', 'The history, exam, and labs established stroke as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made sudden brain injury from ischemia or hemorrhage the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把卒中定为工作诊断。'),
  ('c97919f2-7220-5aa2-9e48-9b55aed74e14', 'The serum dextran was outside the reference range and changed overnight care.', 'The blood amount of polysaccharide plasma expander was outside the usual range.', '血清右旋糖酐偏离参考范围，改变了夜间处理。'),
  ('575ba64d-cbe9-55c4-a38c-68b0c89816d0', 'The drug was given by a subcutaneous route because the gut could not be used.', 'The drug went in beneath the skin, a common injection route because the gut could not be used.', '肠道无法使用时，药物经皮下的途径给予。'),
  ('ebe7f837-a5ab-50a8-beff-2ae8cd1389f6', 'Despite fluids, vomitus continued into the second hospital day.', 'material ejected from the stomach was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，呕吐物仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('44d59afa-8126-5bc9-8571-aa06941203dd', 'She reported syncope as the complaint that brought her in.', 'She came in because of brief loss of consciousness from hypoperfusion.', '她把晕厥说成促使就诊的主诉。'),
  ('b9f0e306-477e-561a-8c5e-16d95e39c64f', 'The overnight chart recorded spermatic cord among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded cord carrying vas, vessels, and nerves to the testis among the active findings.', '夜间病程把精索记入当前发现。'),
  ('cf452a4f-e585-5ce0-972e-793beb922715', 'The biopsy confirmed glomerulonephritis and excluded a competing infection.', 'Tissue exam confirmed inflammation of the glomeruli and ruled out another infection.', '活检证实了肾小球肾炎，并排除了另一种感染。'),
  ('acf45d35-6d1d-58fb-962f-66be13d7f871', 'The ligament connects bone to bone.', 'This structure connects bone to bone.', '该韧带在体内承担这一功能。'),
  ('f1aa1ad1-fbce-5c8c-8c68-f4e1280b179e', 'The flare of pyelonephritis brought pain and a rising CRP.', 'When infection of the renal pelvis and kidney worsened, pain and CRP rose together.', '肾盂肾炎加重时出现疼痛和 CRP 升高。'),
  ('62dada54-2159-53b5-8149-9f0fc58893bc', 'The pregnancy visit documented uterus among the current findings.', 'The pregnancy visit documented organ that carries a pregnancy among the current findings.', '产检把子宫写入当前发现。'),
  ('6fcc5eb4-f2a7-5fe2-8e80-bcb951cd148f', 'The mitral stenosis was attributed to rheumatic heart disease years after the fever.', 'The tight mitral valve was blamed on valve damage after rheumatic fever.', '二尖瓣狭窄归因于多年前风湿热后的风湿性心脏病。'),
  ('009c6232-d43e-55b3-b5e8-6982ea7c3248', 'The overnight chart recorded piles among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded hemorrhoids among the active findings.', '夜间病程把痔记入当前发现。'),
  ('668d5e3a-d1a1-540d-b568-41eab7d02166', 'The history, exam, and labs established varix as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made permanently dilated vein the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把静脉曲张定为工作诊断。'),
  ('87f636ad-058b-5208-9539-3ab2e2f330e7', 'A new valvular murmur appeared after the febrile illness.', 'A new heart murmur from abnormal valve flow appeared after the fever.', '发热性疾病后出现新的瓣膜性杂音。'),
  ('a8cc902e-d818-5758-a7f7-9ab4c05c183d', 'The flare of phlebitis brought pain and a rising CRP.', 'When inflammation of a vein worsened, pain and CRP rose together.', '静脉炎加重时出现疼痛和 CRP 升高。'),
  ('c8153d0b-ad43-5845-a431-b2ca7c413e5b', 'Despite fluids, etiology continued into the second hospital day.', 'cause of a disease was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，病因仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('5ac4ce7b-3c1b-5bb7-8b08-37a20e231110', 'The smear showed the hemocyte among the reacting cells.', 'The smear showed this cell type (blood cell) among the reacting cells.', '涂片在反应细胞中见到血细胞。'),
  ('d0c38449-1fe0-5456-8113-fe0b95578052', 'The falling leukocyte count explained the new infection risk.', 'Fewer of these cells (white blood cell of host defense) explained the new infection risk.', '白细胞计数下降解释了新的感染风险。'),
  ('934c32f4-4dfa-52d7-9aef-bf944c05a417', 'Care still had to account for thymus gland after the overnight change.', 'Care still had to account for gland where T lymphocytes mature after the overnight change.', '夜间变化后，处理仍需考虑胸腺。'),
  ('dc5c8f5c-2b95-5ea3-b6fe-4ddb9feaee68', 'The falling platelets count explained the new infection risk.', 'Fewer of these cells (cell fragments that help blood clot) explained the new infection risk.', '血小板计数下降解释了新的感染风险。'),
  ('7b42ed11-49ff-56cc-bfd9-b6cd535398af', 'The overnight chart recorded lymphoid organs among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded organs of the immune system such as nodes and spleen among the active findings.', '夜间病程把淋巴器官记入当前发现。'),
  ('89eff71c-a36e-5e9d-881f-6989e313ca60', 'Despite fluids, thrombocytes continued into the second hospital day.', 'another name for platelets was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，血小板仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('26c887c4-1585-54fd-9191-3781971469e2', 'Macrophages cleared debris from the wound bed overnight.', 'Scavenger cells cleared broken-down fragments from the wound.', '巨噬细胞在夜间清除了伤口床上的残渣。'),
  ('8476adeb-5e6c-5402-9170-676695d601aa', 'After injury the clotting cells no longer participate in clot formation.', 'After injury this structure no longer participate in clot formation.', '损伤之后，凝血细胞不再能完成应有的工作。'),
  ('137081b4-302a-5b28-b327-aea02789c5c3', 'The finding was cytotoxic on examination.', 'On exam the finding was able to kill cells.', '查体时该发现是细胞毒性的的。'),
  ('59fa516f-f800-51e0-9cc8-14eb3f8a7b4a', 'The interferon helps resist viral infection.', 'This structure helps resist viral infection.', '该干扰素在体内承担这一功能。'),
  ('cf17fcc4-8c29-5e03-91bd-463a76677c23', 'Serial fibrinogen measurements tracked the overnight metabolic change.', 'Repeated measurements of plasma protein converted to fibrin in clotting tracked the overnight metabolic change.', '连续纤维蛋白原测定追踪了夜间代谢变化。'),
  ('71111b97-24d5-524e-8758-a8455abcbaed', 'Despite nearby swelling the interleukins still signal among white cells.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still signal among white cells.', '尽管附近肿胀，白细胞介素仍在工作。'),
  ('4da77395-6aec-5aa8-958e-1fa71f7b133a', 'After injury the fibrin no longer stabilizes a clot.', 'After injury this structure no longer stabilizes a clot.', '损伤之后，纤维蛋白不再能完成应有的工作。'),
  ('fce8a0a8-783d-554e-9e0a-9d2cde8cb38a', 'The overnight chart recorded anemia among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded too little hemoglobin or too few red cells among the active findings.', '夜间病程把贫血记入当前发现。'),
  ('0e9ea64d-b3ad-5df4-b9e5-85bc7d9ca397', 'Despite nearby swelling the albumin still maintains oncotic pressure.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still maintains oncotic pressure.', '尽管附近肿胀，白蛋白仍在工作。'),
  ('f076e1a3-4cfd-51b8-8fa4-1bef1d515e1f', 'Overnight fatigue worsened and directed the next exam.', 'Overnight tiredness not relieved by ordinary rest got worse and directed the next exam.', '夜间疲劳加重，并指导下一步检查。'),
  ('92b13e35-47f8-5c30-849a-7c93e27d3e03', 'The low globulin level left too little antibody protein against infection.', 'Low globulin meant there was not enough antibody protein to fight infection.', '球蛋白偏低，对抗感染的抗体蛋白不足。'),
  ('cebda604-8734-578c-a874-6c0f66a74047', 'Overnight heart palpitation worsened and directed the next exam.', 'Overnight awareness of an irregular or forceful heartbeat got worse and directed the next exam.', '夜间心悸加重，并指导下一步检查。'),
  ('51f40c99-1c2a-510d-9112-b8b016816aac', 'The serum prothrombin was outside the reference range and changed overnight care.', 'The blood amount of clotting factor converted to thrombin was outside the usual range.', '血清凝血酶原偏离参考范围，改变了夜间处理。'),
  ('415f00ce-3d36-50aa-a11f-b9766263198a', 'Overnight pallor worsened and directed the next exam.', 'Overnight paleness of skin or mucosa got worse and directed the next exam.', '夜间苍白加重，并指导下一步检查。'),
  ('17c23d3c-ddb4-5b0b-b246-898c40b17985', 'The thalassemia workup asked which globin chain was under-produced.', 'The anemia workup asked which hemoglobin protein chain was short.', '地中海贫血评估要问哪一条珠蛋白链合成不足。'),
  ('7c199358-2185-510f-8858-cc4285889f31', 'Local irritation of the airway triggered cough and wheeze.', 'Local unpleasant stimulation of the airway triggered cough.', '气道局部刺激引发咳嗽和哮鸣。'),
  ('968fd1f2-e8e1-5b61-84f3-d1a0e792fae5', 'Serial hemoglobin measurements tracked the overnight metabolic change.', 'Repeated measurements of oxygen-carrying protein of red cells tracked the overnight metabolic change.', '连续血红蛋白测定追踪了夜间代谢变化。'),
  ('4e71b93e-0931-5661-9707-c2f2d54a4bcb', 'Despite fluids, aplastic anemia continued into the second hospital day.', 'anemia from failed marrow blood-cell production was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，再生障碍性贫血仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('04e7230b-3db9-535b-812f-f9fc10d2619c', 'Excess pigment darkened the surgical scar over months.', 'A colored substance in the tissue darkened the scar.', '数月后过多色素使手术瘢痕变深。'),
  ('d0cb2570-1560-5f0c-9f5d-979043b26337', 'The overnight chart recorded pancytopenia among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded low red cells, white cells, and platelets together among the active findings.', '夜间病程把全血细胞减少记入当前发现。'),
  ('12f164d2-388d-5a00-ac0e-bc0b4fc9d85e', 'Jaundice rose as heme from broken red cells was converted to bilirubin.', 'Yellowing increased as the iron-containing part of hemoglobin broke down.', '红细胞破坏后，血红素转化为胆红素，黄疸加重。'),
  ('38227adc-b09b-5502-b42c-18a4c059848f', 'Despite fluids, hemolytic anemia continued into the second hospital day.', 'anemia from premature red-cell destruction was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，溶血性贫血仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('d368550f-cea5-5775-aec9-3f31a62bb1f1', 'Overnight sampling of electrolyte changed the next decision.', 'Overnight sampling of ion in body fluid such as sodium or potassium changed the next decision.', '夜间对电解质的取样改变了下一步决定。'),
  ('98d9194d-7c6a-5c99-834f-e242db85a69a', 'Despite fluids, clotting factors continued into the second hospital day.', 'plasma proteins of the coagulation cascade was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，凝血因子仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('43f0bcae-0bdd-5401-8edf-dbb4e81202a0', 'Hemolysis with sphere-shaped red cells fitted spherocytosis.', 'Red-cell breakdown with fragile spheres fitted this membrane disorder.', '溶血且红细胞呈球形，符合球形红细胞增多症。'),
  ('56ea3e4a-8c85-5dfd-a0cc-48183251d200', 'After injury the nucleus no longer holds most DNA.', 'After injury this structure no longer holds most DNA.', '损伤之后，细胞核不再能完成应有的工作。'),
  ('7b0fed6c-c0c5-5c70-89b8-fae39d1f2df8', 'Despite nearby swelling the erythropoietin still stimulates red-cell production.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still stimulates red-cell production.', '尽管附近肿胀，促红细胞生成素仍在工作。'),
  ('3c611e7b-2902-54d8-994c-ec0655d99eb1', 'The overnight note described the finding as pernicious.', 'The night note described the finding as destructive; in pernicious anemia, B12-deficiency anemia.', '夜间病程把该发现写成恶性的。'),
  ('81e5be37-d94f-5290-aa77-542deb85f29d', 'The overnight chart recorded granulocytes among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded white cells with granules: neutrophils, eosinophils, basophils among the active findings.', '夜间病程把粒细胞记入当前发现。'),
  ('6fb90b32-4bda-5599-bbad-b5af1db0f48f', 'The falling megaloblast count explained the new infection risk.', 'Fewer of these cells (abnormally large nucleated red-cell precursor) explained the new infection risk.', '巨幼红细胞计数下降解释了新的感染风险。'),
  ('5de22b1f-b7e7-59f5-8950-9dd87e5346f3', 'The smear showed the eosinophil among the reacting cells in the allergic flare.', 'The smear showed this allergy-related granulocyte among the reacting cells.', '过敏发作时，涂片在反应细胞中见到嗜酸性粒细胞。'),
  ('3f0b5183-2854-58e7-8c9a-291c04fb7c7a', 'Painful crises occur when sickle cell anemia distorts red cells in small vessels.', 'Painful attacks happen when sickle-shaped red cells jam small vessels.', '镰状细胞贫血使红细胞在小血管里变形时，就会出现疼痛危象。'),
  ('9e91c3ee-13c3-507c-a168-3e713f3c5e92', 'Despite nearby swelling the basophil still releases histamine.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still releases histamine.', '尽管附近肿胀，嗜碱性粒细胞仍在工作。'),
  ('d51944d9-8a70-5cbb-9940-352cd830ce2d', 'The falling neutrophil count explained the new infection risk.', 'Fewer of these cells (main phagocyte of acute bacterial infection) explained the new infection risk.', '中性粒细胞计数下降解释了新的感染风险。'),
  ('d650b90d-e7bf-5e14-b2cd-877197e2e6c4', 'She reported arthralgias as the complaint that brought her in.', 'She came in because of joint pains without necessary swelling.', '她把关节痛说成促使就诊的主诉。'),
  ('25e4f213-805e-5199-9670-1b5b84cd9a5e', 'The falling agranulocyte count explained the new infection risk.', 'Fewer of these cells (white cell without obvious granules, such as a lymphocyte) explained the new infection risk.', '无粒白细胞计数下降解释了新的感染风险。'),
  ('7d65f428-de59-5d59-9eb7-ee6fe9044f69', 'The exam localized the injury to the extremities.', 'The exam found the injury at this structure (arms and legs).', '查体把损伤定位在四肢。'),
  ('68d63cc6-4e2f-5872-b19c-f778284e7b8d', 'The falling monocyte count explained the new infection risk.', 'Fewer of these cells (circulating precursor of macrophages) explained the new infection risk.', '单核细胞计数下降解释了新的感染风险。'),
  ('6e8d5c02-a762-59f9-92a0-8f51515637ce', 'After the insult, ulceration occurred in the affected tissue.', 'After the insult this process (process of forming an ulcer) took place in the tissue.', '损伤之后，受累组织发生了溃疡形成。'),
  ('b0857941-eb45-5d03-92d4-e89d55c10551', 'The falling lymphocyte count explained the new infection risk.', 'Fewer of these cells (T or B white cell of adaptive immunity) explained the new infection risk.', '淋巴细胞计数下降解释了新的感染风险。'),
  ('2e242195-a40f-566f-869f-d793af6a4a04', 'The history, exam, and labs established thalassemia as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made inherited defect in globin-chain synthesis the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把地中海贫血定为工作诊断。'),
  ('6258e412-0d24-5136-b09e-e69a032b9325', 'The overnight note described the finding as polymorphonuclear.', 'The night note described the finding as having a multi-lobed nucleus, as neutrophils do.', '夜间病程把该发现写成多形核的。'),
  ('b9288629-eea8-595c-94ff-86ef31bba48b', 'The history, exam, and labs established thrombocytopenia as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made abnormally low platelet count the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把血小板减少定为工作诊断。'),
  ('6733db33-26b4-5eb2-b65a-db0b5da1f30d', 'The liver can detoxify many drugs before they reach the rest of the body.', 'The liver can make many drugs less harmful before they travel onward.', '肝脏能在许多药物到达全身其他部位之前把它们解毒。'),
  ('8d2249d7-1e94-567b-bbb0-9a41f2b948da', 'The history, exam, and labs established petechiae as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made tiny pinpoint hemorrhages in skin or mucosa the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把瘀点定为工作诊断。'),
  ('728e512c-f700-579e-94d5-b2d5c932a3a7', 'The overnight order stopped heparin after the new rash appeared.', 'The night order stopped this medicine (anticoagulant used to prevent clotting) when the rash appeared.', '新皮疹出现后，夜间医嘱停用了肝素。'),
  ('806cef1c-cfe5-53e9-820b-def1bba017cc', 'The overnight chart recorded ecchymosis among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded larger subcutaneous bleed; a bruise among the active findings.', '夜间病程把瘀斑记入当前发现。'),
  ('83532c44-e96d-50b4-869c-5dd28dcbf124', 'The overnight note described the finding as phagocytic.', 'The night note described the finding as able to engulf particles or microbes.', '夜间病程把该发现写成吞噬的。'),
  ('5c78e85d-3a92-5a06-b9cf-cb230ccb4ab7', 'Non-blanching purpura on the legs raised concern for low platelets.', 'Purple spots that did not fade raised concern for low platelets.', '下肢压之不褪色的紫癜，提示血小板偏低。'),
  ('5293f4ec-d523-5b29-bb13-665a54a0d41d', 'Tissue macrophages cleared debris after the neutrophils had already arrived.', 'Resident scavenger cells mopped up remaining fragments.', '中性粒细胞到场后，组织巨噬细胞清除残渣。'),
  ('e69d9532-4088-558b-83c8-b2b1fa17fe37', 'The history, exam, and labs established hemophilia as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made inherited clotting-factor deficiency with bleeding the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把血友病定为工作诊断。'),
  ('c9f68390-5cb7-5e8a-b5f4-5898771b3105', 'The drug was given by a intramuscular route because the gut could not be used.', 'The drug went in into a muscle, a common injection route because the gut could not be used.', '肠道无法使用时，药物经肌内的途径给予。'),
  ('4c07b9d7-f594-59fc-9551-5514640d6cfb', 'Neutrophils and macrophages used phagocytosis to engulf bacteria and other harmful material.', 'White cells swallowed the bacteria and debris so they could clear them from the tissue.', '中性粒细胞和巨噬细胞通过吞噬作用吞入细菌和其他有害物质。'),
  ('74cb642f-311e-58d8-9196-351a7e3b1101', 'Despite fluids, autoimmune disease continued into the second hospital day.', 'disease in which the immune system attacks host tissue was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，自身免疫病仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('c7d7ebb5-140f-5177-bf7c-96b9e765bcf9', 'The smear showed the megakaryocyte among the reacting cells.', 'The smear showed this cell type (large marrow cell that sheds platelets) among the reacting cells.', '涂片在反应细胞中见到巨核细胞。'),
  ('86a5f977-9adf-5e3a-9d5c-5b26d6426682', 'Overnight physiology still depended on hemostasis remaining intact.', 'Overnight physiology still needed this process (stopping of bleeding) to keep working.', '夜间生理仍取决于止血保持完整。'),
  ('032673a5-8037-592d-a40d-6ff5c5d71821', 'The history, exam, and labs established hematuria as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made blood in the urine the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把血尿定为工作诊断。'),
  ('fce5e45c-b7f3-5d65-8114-5aac48304e4e', 'The swollen knee after minor trauma fitted hemarthrosis in hemophilia.', 'The swollen knee fitted bleeding into a joint.', '轻微外伤后膝关节肿胀，符合血友病的关节积血。'),
  ('28174567-eac1-5b80-b7d9-600b65877ef1', 'The smear showed the myeloblast among the reacting cells.', 'The smear showed this cell type (immature myeloid white-cell precursor) among the reacting cells.', '涂片在反应细胞中见到成髓细胞。'),
  ('36be2590-2e42-5dc0-9416-2a67628c2ad5', 'Despite fluids, leukemia continued into the second hospital day.', 'malignancy of white blood cells was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，白血病仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('266d144f-4af8-5874-904d-edc6d03297ef', 'The history, exam, and labs established neoplasms as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made abnormal new growths; tumors the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把肿瘤；新生物定为工作诊断。'),
  ('c6b0a633-93cf-536b-9b09-70e0d3df8fe5', 'The falling lymphoblast count explained the new infection risk.', 'Fewer of these cells (immature lymphocyte precursor) explained the new infection risk.', '成淋巴细胞计数下降解释了新的感染风险。'),
  ('06f709b0-2434-5f67-a124-5315f4ff762e', 'The history, exam, and labs established acute myelogenous leukemia as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made fast myeloid-line blood cancer the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把急性髓系白血病定为工作诊断。'),
  ('71941e70-67f7-5a0f-a6f7-84165068f2ea', 'Despite fluids, hypercalcemia continued into the second hospital day.', 'abnormally high blood calcium was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，高钙血症仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('d0a9f260-702f-52e8-a992-356162ab121e', 'After injury the itching no longer makes a person want to scratch.', 'After injury this structure no longer makes a person want to scratch.', '损伤之后，瘙痒不再能完成应有的工作。'),
  ('1247d5d4-0a64-5f67-a816-17c1b87c0402', 'Despite fluids, acute lymphocytic leukemia continued into the second hospital day.', 'fast lymphoid-line blood cancer, especially in children was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，急性淋巴细胞白血病仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('0cf70485-96aa-5a62-a99a-ca585d1c512d', 'A blanching rash spread over the trunk after the second drug dose.', 'A visible skin eruption spread after the second dose.', '第二次给药后，躯干出现可消退的皮疹。'),
  ('7a45fa84-cdc4-5364-bdc5-f65c96179b82', 'The overnight chart recorded sneezing among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded sudden explosive expulsion of air from the nose among the active findings.', '夜间病程把喷嚏记入当前发现。'),
  ('0c16a8c9-345a-59ab-aac4-95e11caf4b23', 'The history, exam, and labs established chronic myelogenous leukemia as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made slower myeloid leukemia often with a Philadelphia chromosome the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把慢性髓系白血病定为工作诊断。'),
  ('552c1f3f-9147-56a0-8a01-00b60b8e4296', 'Overnight urticaria worsened and directed the next exam.', 'Overnight itchy wheals; hives got worse and directed the next exam.', '夜间荨麻疹加重，并指导下一步检查。'),
  ('5417db13-1d14-553c-96c7-853995fef167', 'The history, exam, and labs established immunodeficiency as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made impaired ability to fight infection the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把免疫缺陷定为工作诊断。'),
  ('0919b941-a8bc-54d0-8cc2-456878ce93ff', 'Recurrent sinus infection with odd immunoglobulin numbers fitted dysgammaglobulinemia.', 'Repeated sinus infection plus abnormal antibody proteins fitted this immune-protein disorder.', '反复鼻窦感染且免疫球蛋白谱异常，符合丙种球蛋白异常血症。'),
  ('1843fcc0-d4be-5f3b-a3f9-7d6390329f3f', 'The fall produced a fracture involving the multiple myeloma.', 'The fall broke this structure (plasma-cell cancer of bone marrow).', '跌倒造成多发性骨髓瘤骨折。'),
  ('2b4ec80b-b75b-58a1-8884-743b6adc79f9', 'Serial plasma cells measurements tracked the overnight metabolic change.', 'Repeated measurements of antibody-secreting B-lineage cells tracked the overnight metabolic change.', '连续浆细胞测定追踪了夜间代谢变化。'),
  ('18de23cd-e2e9-577f-a627-5429da58d6a5', 'The finding was extrinsic on examination.', 'On exam the finding was coming from outside the organ or pathway.', '查体时该发现是外源性的的。'),
  ('8c0ba720-ecda-54ab-8d33-05339a8b7264', 'The overnight note described the finding as osteolytic.', 'The night note described the finding as causing bone destruction.', '夜间病程把该发现写成溶骨的。'),
  ('8a53abbd-4efa-5b24-b1f2-84959024ef1d', 'The finding was intrinsic on examination.', 'On exam the finding was arising from within the organ or pathway.', '查体时该发现是内源性的的。'),
  ('c4b0d391-60cf-5075-81c1-26099d247b3f', 'Despite fluids, lymphadenopathy continued into the second hospital day.', 'enlarged or abnormal lymph nodes was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，淋巴结病仍持续到住院第二天。'),
