  ('4158fd84-f33b-54c0-aa44-1f0949392a57', 'Serial target tissue measurements tracked the overnight metabolic change.', 'Repeated measurements of tissue on which a hormone acts tracked the overnight metabolic change.', '连续靶组织测定追踪了夜间代谢变化。'),
  ('e36fb0e6-86d8-5198-8c4a-6e8bfa934253', 'Despite nearby swelling the gland still secretes a product.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still secretes a product.', '尽管附近肿胀，腺仍在工作。'),
  ('9bbeebfc-cee0-563f-bfb4-b6b95aa72309', 'The receptor binds a ligand and starts a signal.', 'This structure binds a ligand and starts a signal.', '该受体在体内承担这一功能。'),
  ('9c8ab71d-28dd-55ce-85e4-062e32538ed3', 'The glandular findings involved a gland rather than a distant system.', 'The findings about a gland explained the main complaint.', '这些腺的发现涉及相关结构，而不是远处系统。'),
  ('e1cfb5c6-230d-5075-ac1c-2e2c4369adc4', 'The hormonal examination focused on hormones.', 'The exam looked at hormones.', '激素的检查聚焦在相关结构上。'),
  ('1ad65ad0-e039-521b-a007-0a2ded747f44', 'The overnight order stopped steroid after the new rash appeared.', 'The night order stopped this medicine (corticosteroid or related antiinflammatory hormone analog) when the rash appeared.', '新皮疹出现后，夜间医嘱停用了类固醇。'),
  ('76a5b28b-7c0a-5963-89de-dbb016f8dd26', 'Contact with epinephrine injured the mucosa and changed local pH.', 'Contact with this substance (American pharmacologic name for adrenaline) injured the lining and changed local pH.', '接触肾上腺素损伤了黏膜并改变局部 pH。'),
  ('f8d7121d-d0bc-5b35-9bbd-5e33f36ab58b', 'The fasting lipid panel showed high triglyceride after the poorly controlled diabetes.', 'The fasting fat-soluble panel showed high triglyceride.', '空腹血脂显示，糖尿病控制不佳后甘油三酯升高。'),
  ('13372b69-ec16-5d67-86c5-0cab7ed08dd7', 'Contact with norepinephrine injured the mucosa and changed local pH.', 'Contact with this substance (catecholamine neurotransmitter and vasopressor) injured the lining and changed local pH.', '接触去甲肾上腺素损伤了黏膜并改变局部 pH。'),
  ('70fdaf12-42d5-506c-a3fb-c1bbbaa67144', 'Contact with protein injured the mucosa and changed local pH.', 'Contact with this substance (polymer of amino acids with structural or enzyme roles) injured the lining and changed local pH.', '接触蛋白质损伤了黏膜并改变局部 pH。'),
  ('12829e1e-f6af-59f8-b073-15f03725bf80', 'The receptor bound a proteinlike compound and started the intracellular signal.', 'A peptide messenger bound the receptor and started the signal.', '受体结合一种蛋白样化合物并启动细胞内信号。'),
  ('320ef2b6-8395-5ebb-879f-2bdbb0b76bdf', 'The exam localized the injury to the gonad.', 'The exam found the injury at this structure (ovary or testis).', '查体把损伤定位在性腺。'),
  ('f803f477-67be-55f9-9b4f-be042d3d617c', 'The finding was exocrine on examination.', 'On exam the finding was secreting through a duct to a surface.', '查体时该发现是外分泌的的。'),
  ('98f1b6e7-fcdb-5d9b-96ac-843c3aee764f', 'The operation stayed clear of the cortex whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (outer layer of an organ such as kidney or adrenal) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开皮质。'),
  ('01076c34-3151-5098-8947-9e0ace5b706d', 'Insulin output fell after injury to the islets of langerhans.', 'Insulin output fell after injury to the pancreatic endocrine clusters.', '胰岛损伤后胰岛素分泌下降。'),
  ('80fc3d79-410c-514b-8872-af756bb6c2d9', 'The ovarian findings involved the ovary rather than a distant system.', 'The findings about the ovary explained the main complaint.', '这些卵巢的发现涉及相关结构，而不是远处系统。'),
  ('eb1c0b04-a1e5-55dc-969d-255698c62163', 'The follicular-phase estradiol rise preceded the LH surge.', 'The main ovarian estrogen rose before the LH peak.', '卵泡期雌二醇上升出现在 LH 峰之前。'),
  ('62d1cf45-6708-5995-a14f-fdcc3c196968', 'The renin starts the angiotensin cascade.', 'This structure starts the angiotensin cascade.', '该肾素在体内承担这一功能。'),
  ('87e6de5b-61b7-5a68-ad0c-702d4038f4e1', 'Serial calcium measurements tracked the overnight metabolic change.', 'Repeated measurements of mineral of bone, muscle contraction, and clotting tracked the overnight metabolic change.', '连续钙测定追踪了夜间代谢变化。'),
  ('f6da7732-1b51-5056-b37d-c532dc8bc312', 'The obstetric scan assessed the pregnancy before delivery planning.', 'The pregnancy scan assessed state of carrying a developing fetus before delivery planning.', '产科扫描在制定分娩计划前评估了妊娠。'),
  ('a16f8796-8ee6-5467-9bc1-3ba262a1013e', 'The fall produced a fracture involving the phosphorus.', 'The fall broke this structure (essential mineral in bone and energy metabolism).', '跌倒造成磷骨折。'),
  ('9f40f27e-ef79-539c-ac18-c0c2cf09d197', 'Serial malatonin measurements tracked the overnight metabolic change.', 'Repeated measurements of pineal sleep hormone (textbook spelling of melatonin) tracked the overnight metabolic change.', '连续褪黑素测定追踪了夜间代谢变化。'),
  ('e0e021d5-f0ef-55bd-bf4d-c8a26f2d4edb', 'The obstetric note recorded puberty among the active problems.', 'The obstetric note recorded period of becoming sexually mature among the active problems.', '产科记录把青春期列入当前问题。'),
  ('7c37fe54-6ae0-5257-aa06-4504d35a84fe', 'Cortisol still followed circadian rhythms even during the illness.', 'Cortisol still followed the about-24-hour biologic cycle.', '即使在患病期间，皮质醇仍遵循昼夜节律。'),
  ('ba996c8b-3460-570d-83e1-6a4690f6441f', 'The overnight chart recorded parathyroid among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded small glands that raise blood calcium via PTH among the active findings.', '夜间病程把甲状旁腺记入当前发现。'),
  ('1079510d-caa0-539d-8600-203060cac002', 'Despite nearby swelling the parathyroid hormone still raises blood calcium.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still raises blood calcium.', '尽管附近肿胀，甲状旁腺激素仍在工作。'),
  ('45979cf0-ee1f-5c30-8b11-17cf6af3602d', 'The pineal examination correlated with the bedside signs.', 'Exam of this region (relating to the pineal gland) matched the bedside signs.', '松果体的检查与床旁体征相符。'),
  ('92631926-212c-503a-a955-1d74e46d9723', 'After injury the calcitonin no longer lowers blood calcium.', 'After injury this structure no longer lowers blood calcium.', '损伤之后，降钙素不再能完成应有的工作。'),
  ('57c56cbd-d44f-54f5-9e34-c34e8a606611', 'The operation stayed clear of the sphenoid whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (bone at the base of the skull housing the pituitary fossa) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开蝶骨。'),
  ('5bd93756-a23b-5cd2-ae5f-93d49c544770', 'Cortisol fell after injury to the anterior lobe of the pituitary.', 'Cortisol fell after injury to the front pituitary lobe.', '垂体前叶损伤后皮质醇下降。'),
  ('54bae21c-761a-58db-8870-cd8fdf4a35eb', 'The history, exam, and labs established primary aldosteronism as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made excess aldosterone from the adrenal itself the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把原发性醛固酮增多症定为工作诊断。'),
  ('dfdc2269-2a03-5aa0-afe7-18382744f75c', 'The operation stayed clear of the adenohypophysis whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (anterior pituitary) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开腺垂体。'),
  ('9d08a329-8570-5fcf-a1e7-afb26192b1ed', 'Diabetes insipidus followed injury to the posterior lobe.', 'Large volumes of dilute urine followed injury to the back pituitary lobe.', '垂体后叶损伤后出现尿崩症。'),
  ('40b7e1a8-a361-5e39-b015-8680e78759ee', 'Contact with pheochromocytoma injured the mucosa and changed local pH.', 'Contact with this substance (catecholamine-secreting adrenal medullary tumor) injured the lining and changed local pH.', '接触嗜铬细胞瘤损伤了黏膜并改变局部 pH。'),
  ('c1fb3b6b-813a-5070-9926-c9994f4a6b10', 'The operation stayed clear of the neurohypophysis whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (posterior pituitary) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开神经垂体。'),
  ('ea3f836d-1fac-52ee-a91d-d66a434f80a3', 'Contact with gigantism injured the mucosa and changed local pH.', 'Contact with this substance (excess growth hormone before epiphyseal closure) injured the lining and changed local pH.', '接触巨人症损伤了黏膜并改变局部 pH。'),
  ('10954a04-e4e9-55a4-8eff-9cd11b710985', 'After injury the hypothalamus no longer controls pituitary and autonomic function.', 'After injury this structure no longer controls pituitary and autonomic function.', '损伤之后，下丘脑不再能完成应有的工作。'),
  ('3b3c4d5c-44c2-5300-8f4a-822e1222e5c1', 'Contact with acromegaly injured the mucosa and changed local pH.', 'Contact with this substance (excess growth hormone after epiphyseal closure) injured the lining and changed local pH.', '接触肢端肥大症损伤了黏膜并改变局部 pH。'),
  ('be7e4be2-5b69-5a08-8824-4596f9544fcc', 'The mammary examination focused on the breast.', 'The exam looked at the breast.', '乳房的检查聚焦在相关结构上。'),
  ('053b857d-7e41-5dfc-b37a-78817d8112ba', 'The overnight chart recorded diabetes insipidus among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded large volumes of dilute urine from ADH lack or resistance among the active findings.', '夜间病程把尿崩症记入当前发现。'),
  ('23ec7d7f-6d2d-5933-b7e0-4703430e333f', 'The finding was antidiuretic on examination.', 'On exam the finding was reducing urine volume, as ADH does.', '查体时该发现是抗利尿的的。'),
  ('b975efad-cb1e-5986-b9d6-201dd234429f', 'Weight loss, tremor, and a suppressed TSH fitted hyperthyroidism.', 'Losing weight, shaking, and a low TSH fitted excess thyroid hormone.', '体重下降、震颤和 TSH 受抑制，符合甲状腺功能亢进。'),
  ('7c7dc686-fcb0-5b62-bb47-0a2664a8e153', 'The uterine examination focused on the uterus.', 'The exam looked at the uterus.', '子宫的检查聚焦在相关结构上。'),
  ('782dca7d-8543-55b6-a719-d7fff6f348e4', 'The operation stayed clear of the isthmus whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (narrow connection, such as the thyroid isthmus) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开峡。'),
  ('6918936d-c343-53dc-a803-3e6cd5884790', 'The serum hyperparathyroidism was outside the reference range and changed overnight care.', 'The blood amount of excess parathyroid hormone with high calcium was outside the usual range.', '血清甲状旁腺功能亢进偏离参考范围，改变了夜间处理。'),
  ('6810143c-7754-5dee-8405-c42804afc042', 'Serial thyroxine measurements tracked the overnight metabolic change.', 'Repeated measurements of T4, the main circulating thyroid hormone tracked the overnight metabolic change.', '连续甲状腺素测定追踪了夜间代谢变化。'),
  ('b1b2d93f-125b-59b9-945f-b6c8da68ffa6', 'Low calcium with a low PTH fitted hypoparathyroidism after neck surgery.', 'Low calcium plus low parathyroid hormone fitted underactive parathyroid glands.', '颈部手术后，低钙且 PTH 低，符合甲状旁腺功能减退。'),
  ('e81f5e53-5f45-5143-9a48-de6699239203', 'The serum triiodothyronine was outside the reference range and changed overnight care.', 'The blood amount of T3, the more active thyroid hormone was outside the usual range.', '血清三碘甲腺原氨酸偏离参考范围，改变了夜间处理。'),
  ('a3deb3ae-6bfa-5208-af88-42230389ed19', 'The history, exam, and labs established hyperglycemia as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made abnormally high blood glucose the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把高血糖定为工作诊断。'),
  ('1547939d-b5b6-5b9b-ba34-b1a28b1dc4c0', 'Overnight physiology still depended on homeostasis remaining intact.', 'Overnight physiology still needed this process (maintenance of a stable internal environment) to keep working.', '夜间生理仍取决于稳态保持完整。'),
  ('59c06fff-d1c5-506d-bcc9-37baa9b43f63', 'The medullar examination correlated with the bedside signs.', 'Exam of this region (relating to a medulla (textbook form of medullary)) matched the bedside signs.', '髓质的检查与床旁体征相符。'),
  ('51ab90f5-7c23-585c-a38e-b92c94ec6c5c', 'Serial corticosteroid measurements tracked the overnight metabolic change.', 'Repeated measurements of adrenal-type steroid used to suppress inflammation tracked the overnight metabolic change.', '连续糖皮质激素测定追踪了夜间代谢变化。'),
  ('079ea698-d0cc-5238-b771-9c6ab9385232', 'Polyuria began once glucose spilled into the urine.', 'Large urine volume began once blood sugar spilled into the urine.', '一旦葡萄糖溢入尿中，就开始多尿。'),
  ('bc4de617-cfca-516c-8ab2-8d9424f50403', 'The glucocorticoid raises glucose and suppresses inflammation.', 'This structure raises glucose and suppresses inflammation.', '该糖皮质激素在体内承担这一功能。'),
  ('e0394683-14b5-569a-8528-11b6abe3d55d', 'The history, exam, and labs established ketoacidosis as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made high ketones with metabolic acidosis, usually in type 1 diabetes the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把酮症酸中毒定为工作诊断。'),
  ('9a040d2d-7c13-5c70-8f47-a93e69b6cc0e', 'An early-morning cortisol was low and the patient remained hypotensive.', 'The main adrenal glucocorticoid was low, and blood pressure stayed down.', '清晨皮质醇偏低，患者持续低血压。'),
  ('1876c708-ac19-5fb7-b6c4-fe3161153dd3', 'The history, exam, and labs established endemic goiter as the working diagnosis.', 'History, exam, and labs made goiter common in an iodine-deficient region the working diagnosis.', '病史、查体和化验把地方性甲状腺肿定为工作诊断。'),
  ('f11be7bf-f1b0-5f38-9506-bf73bc463602', 'After injury the mineralocorticoid no longer retains sodium, such as aldosterone.', 'After injury this structure no longer retains sodium, such as aldosterone.', '损伤之后，盐皮质激素不再能完成应有的工作。'),
  ('6df1f1ef-11e7-5eb4-b543-9afd4b5019fd', 'Despite nearby swelling the aldosterone still retains sodium.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still retains sodium.', '尽管附近肿胀，醛固酮仍在工作。'),
  ('215ab755-41d3-531a-8b17-0d27911e16f3', 'The neck exam found a nodular goiter and a suppressed TSH.', 'The neck exam found an enlarged thyroid containing nodules.', '颈部查体发现结节性甲状腺肿，且 TSH 受抑制。'),
  ('41a9ed0c-ba50-556c-94f6-e1bf890bcb38', 'The overnight chart recorded bruit among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded abnormal vascular sound heard with a stethoscope among the active findings.', '夜间病程把杂音记入当前发现。'),
  ('4b547585-60c9-56f4-ae11-542bc1866c9d', 'Despite fluids, myxedema continued into the second hospital day.', 'severe hypothyroidism with doughy swelling was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，黏液性水肿仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('ff69183f-46c4-50f0-b7ec-a9b8e5f3ad03', 'Unilateral ptosis of the eyelid appeared with the third-nerve palsy.', 'One eyelid drooped with the third-nerve palsy.', '动眼神经麻痹时出现单侧眼睑下垂。'),
  ('feefd7e2-e209-5d6a-89ef-dc43502116fa', 'The falling neuron count explained the new infection risk.', 'Fewer of these cells (electrically signaling cell of the nervous system) explained the new infection risk.', '神经元计数下降解释了新的感染风险。'),
  ('6c2602bd-99fa-55c7-ac71-c59658e01ae1', 'The operation stayed clear of the diencephalon whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (brain region including thalamus and hypothalamus) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开间脑。'),
  ('a492000c-a567-578c-a96c-19a880483bd0', 'The exam localized the injury to the pons after the pinpoint pupils appeared.', 'The exam found the injury at the brainstem bulge after the pupils pinpointed.', '针尖样瞳孔出现后，查体把损伤定位在脑桥。'),
  ('61cf826a-d9c2-5014-8b41-08f783b4325a', 'The unexpected finding made sense only after neurology of the nervous system and its diseases was applied.', 'Only this field (study of the nervous system and its diseases) made the finding understandable.', '这一意外发现要靠神经病学才能解释。'),
  ('4efd4bff-ff57-50cc-bc05-2c3e7a0b1abb', 'Despite nearby swelling the cerebellum still coordinates movement.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still coordinates movement.', '尽管附近肿胀，小脑仍在工作。'),
  ('f65085aa-acf4-51aa-9090-99a7c6b676b7', 'The serum acetylcholine was outside the reference range and changed overnight care.', 'The blood amount of neurotransmitter at neuromuscular and many autonomic synapses was outside the usual range.', '血清乙酰胆碱偏离参考范围，改变了夜间处理。'),
  ('9ff63c44-3af9-50fb-8f73-b598c93b0f43', 'The overnight chart recorded brain stem among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded midbrain, pons, and medulla connecting brain and cord among the active findings.', '夜间病程把脑干记入当前发现。'),
  ('45f2392b-53da-58fd-b1ca-c8d2b4f6fe4f', 'The finding was efferent on examination.', 'On exam the finding was carrying impulses away from a center.', '查体时该发现是传出的的。'),
  ('018e223a-68b9-50e3-b07c-63a206937463', 'The exam localized the injury to the medulla oblongata.', 'The exam found the injury at this structure (lowest brainstem, continuous with the spinal cord).', '查体把损伤定位在延髓。'),
  ('618fc82b-768a-5851-b4ad-c361d4c4f6b3', 'The mass was afferent to the midline vessels.', 'The mass sat carrying impulses toward a center relative to the midline vessels.', '肿物位于中线血管的传入的侧。'),
  ('377d8182-10ba-5721-9a50-a38b0184c64f', 'The operation stayed clear of the meninx whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (one of the meninges covering brain or cord) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开脑膜。'),
  ('f7395ad1-a29d-5272-8116-7e13bcc16b3a', 'The parasympathetic examination focused on the rest-and-digest autonomic division.', 'The exam looked at the rest-and-digest autonomic division.', '副交感的检查聚焦在相关结构上。'),
  ('fc1db592-75a7-5127-8b60-f43c45c3ae58', 'The scan showed swelling around the cauda equina.', 'Imaging showed swelling around this structure (bundle of lumbar and sacral roots below the cord).', '扫描显示马尾周围肿胀。'),
  ('f8b94828-74e5-5850-9bf5-26d657973177', 'The operation stayed clear of the dura whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (tough outer meninx; dura mater) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开硬膜。'),
  ('617e059d-53e2-59b6-a8b6-8112b561efcb', 'The sympathetic findings involved the fight-or-flight autonomic division rather than a distant system.', 'The findings about the fight-or-flight autonomic division explained the main complaint.', '这些交感的发现涉及相关结构，而不是远处系统。'),
  ('051b6370-e95e-58df-a657-708892ed50e6', 'The exam localized the injury to the mater.', 'The exam found the injury at this structure (mater in dura/pia/arachnoid mater, a meningeal layer).', '查体把损伤定位在膜（脑脊膜）。'),
  ('d1e5c68a-c24f-5258-8c12-ae479e937184', 'The operation stayed clear of the arachnoid whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (middle meningeal layer) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开蛛网膜。'),
  ('dd33f64d-2c5d-5511-b50d-1b3a46dcc7ae', 'The exam localized the injury to the ganglion.', 'The exam found the injury at this structure (cluster of nerve-cell bodies outside the CNS).', '查体把损伤定位在神经节。'),
  ('557e3685-43bb-59a2-b330-16dec67fb13e', 'The scan showed swelling around the pia mater.', 'Imaging showed swelling around this structure (delicate inner meninx on the brain and cord surface).', '扫描显示软膜周围肿胀。'),
  ('2c1eb157-684e-57f2-878a-7e30e3aa6362', 'The operation stayed clear of the plexus whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (network of nerves or vessels) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开丛。'),
  ('d9d5c165-ede2-5d48-a18e-ddc656d844bb', 'After the lumbar puncture, pain scores fell and diet was restarted.', 'After this procedure (needle sampling of CSF in the lumbar sac), pain fell and diet restarted.', '腰椎穿刺之后，疼痛评分下降并重新开始进食。'),
  ('01513836-f4ef-5deb-beff-5059182f7265', 'After injury the dendrite no longer receives synaptic input.', 'After injury this structure no longer receives synaptic input.', '损伤之后，树突不再能完成应有的工作。'),
  ('660ef609-5cff-5d15-b44f-2357849ef978', 'Despite nearby swelling the electrical charge still underlies nerve action potentials.', 'Despite nearby swelling this structure still underlies nerve action potentials.', '尽管附近肿胀，电荷仍在工作。'),
  ('560725b5-5ff6-54ec-88bc-55a04ae33034', 'The axon carries a nerve impulse away.', 'This structure carries a nerve impulse away.', '该轴突在体内承担这一功能。'),
  ('b4049f08-da7e-5627-8d0e-9de12527c710', 'The overnight chart recorded myelin among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded insulating sheath around many axons among the active findings.', '夜间病程把髓鞘质记入当前发现。'),
  ('aaf39cba-1b55-5dc2-907f-6d90811067b7', 'The operation stayed clear of the neurilemma whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (Schwann-cell sheath around a peripheral axon) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开神经膜。'),
  ('4da98763-9a83-5dc1-98de-521ca876da85', 'The toxin blocked the synapse so the muscle never received the impulse.', 'The toxin blocked the junction where one neuron signals another.', '毒素阻断突触，肌肉收不到冲动。'),
  ('297920bd-f719-57f9-955d-f57c2276c23d', 'The exam localized the injury to the white matter.', 'The exam found the injury at this structure (CNS tissue rich in myelinated axons).', '查体把损伤定位在白质。'),
  ('834da682-e5e7-5bc4-b547-d30a8ce07211', 'The operation stayed clear of the gray matter whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (CNS tissue rich in cell bodies) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开灰质。'),
  ('7d30ee10-d652-59a7-8246-6eceb9b2b5d3', 'Too little neurotransmitter at the synapse explained the new weakness.', 'Too little chemical signal at the junction explained the new weakness.', '突触处神经递质过少解释了新出现的无力。'),
  ('dd3d89b8-3556-59ff-958d-08695057883a', 'The falling neuroglia count explained the new infection risk.', 'Fewer of these cells (supporting cells of the nervous system) explained the new infection risk.', '神经胶质计数下降解释了新的感染风险。'),
  ('93175881-ff10-5e97-a2cf-4b1392fb838d', 'The smear showed the astrocyte among the reacting cells.', 'The smear showed this cell type (star-shaped glial cell of the CNS) among the reacting cells.', '涂片在反应细胞中见到星形胶质细胞。'),
  ('ac3ec2af-c7be-5e4d-a639-ae538e6dde10', 'Despite fluids, glioma continued into the second hospital day.', 'tumor of glial cells was still present on day two despite fluids.', '尽管已经补液，胶质瘤仍持续到住院第二天。'),
  ('a46c6749-f2a3-5779-9b0f-01890c4eaee9', 'The smear showed the microglia among the reacting cells.', 'The smear showed this cell type (resident immune cells of the CNS) among the reacting cells.', '涂片在反应细胞中见到小胶质细胞。'),
  ('d8ec1497-dc8d-5009-a42f-f754240494fb', 'Care still had to account for oligodendroglia after the overnight change.', 'Care still had to account for CNS cells that form myelin after the overnight change.', '夜间变化后，处理仍需考虑少突胶质细胞。'),
  ('2925a072-ddd6-5b46-8bfe-23e613300f25', 'The exam localized the injury to the cerebrum.', 'The exam found the injury at this structure (large paired hemispheres of the brain).', '查体把损伤定位在大脑。'),
  ('d2e94e1a-45fe-5180-83ab-7c731b897128', 'The overnight chart recorded convolution among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded gyrus; a fold of the cerebral cortex among the active findings.', '夜间病程把脑回记入当前发现。'),
  ('aea12f5d-8ed5-58c8-af38-9c5be9c55738', 'Overnight the peripheral nervous system could no longer meet the body''s demand.', 'Overnight this system (nerves and ganglia outside the brain and cord) could not keep up.', '夜间周围神经系统已无法满足身体需要。'),
  ('cb1165ca-75c2-58f4-ad85-8e463d3c8bf7', 'The scan showed the autonomic nervous system was the source of the shock picture.', 'Imaging pointed to this system (involuntary visceral motor system) as the source of shock.', '扫描显示休克来自自主神经系统。'),
  ('1f244ab9-19ed-5bd8-9c2a-81508c14bb07', 'Overnight the visceral nervous system could no longer meet the body''s demand.', 'Overnight this system (nerves supplying internal organs) could not keep up.', '夜间内脏神经系统已无法满足身体需要。'),
  ('8852fad9-485c-534b-9533-e640c6b3059b', 'The exam found tenderness over the groove after the fall.', 'Pressing this structure (shallow furrow on a bone or organ surface) hurt after the fall.', '跌倒后，查体发现沟压痛。'),
  ('4a27dba8-4656-5f6d-a826-e686addc8448', 'The MRI showed blood tracking along the interhemispheric fissure.', 'The scan showed blood along the deep cleft between hemispheres.', 'MRI 显示血液沿大脑半球间裂走行。'),
  ('20ae6df3-4f73-5676-8fc9-bb5bf9cbc6bc', 'The overnight chart recorded sulcus among the active findings.', 'The night chart recorded groove between gyri of the cortex among the active findings.', '夜间病程把沟记入当前发现。'),
  ('530e5656-4263-501a-8e28-d066a1e3ebbf', 'The operation stayed clear of the thalamus whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (diencephalic relay for sensory pathways to cortex) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开丘脑。')
